data: {"answer": "This place is the **Lawn · Assembly Point & Continuity** (shown as 'Lakeside Lawn' in the tour). It displays the emergency assembly point and systems like UPS, Backup Generator, and Fire Suppression. The screen shows threats such as Power Outage, Fire, and Flood, along with concepts like BCP, RTO, and RPO. You can also see that the POS is currently down here.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the UPS & Backup Generator do?", "en": "What does the UPS & Backup Generator do?", "zh": "不斷電系統與發電機是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent power outage, fire & flood?", "en": "How do we prevent power outage, fire & flood?", "zh": "停電、火災與淹水要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.07, "total_s": 9.08}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "lawn", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "lawn"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.0}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "lawn", "label": "Room", "en": "Lakeside Lawn", "zh": "湖邊草地"}, {"key": "power", "label": "System", "en": "UPS & Backup Generator", "zh": "不斷電系統與發電機"}, {"key": "environmental", "label": "Threat", "en": "Power Outage, Fire & Flood", "zh": "停電、火災與淹水"}, {"key": "bcp_dr", "label": "Control", "en": "Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery", "zh": "營運持續與災難復原"}, {"key": "environmental_protection", "label": "Control", "en": "UPS, Generator & Fire Suppression", "zh": "不斷電、發電機與滅火設備"}, {"key": "c_bcp", "label": "Concept", "en": "BCP, RTO & RPO", "zh": "營運持續、RTO 與 RPO"}], "edges": [{"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "power"}, {"a": "environmental_protection", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "environmental"}, {"a": "power", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "environmental", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "power"}, {"a": "environmental", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "c_bcp", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "bcp_dr"}, {"a": "bcp_dr", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lawn"}, {"a": "bcp_dr", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "environmental"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Lawn · Assembly Point & Continuity (called 'Lakeside Lawn' in the tour)\nWhat it shows: The emergency assembly point; the business continuity plan says how the resort keeps running when systems or power fail.\nKey lesson: Know the manual fallback for your job before you need it.\nSystems here: UPS & Backup Generator\nThreats shown here: Power Outage, Fire & Flood\nControls you can see: Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery, UPS, Generator & Fire Suppression\nConcepts: BCP, RTO & RPO\nProcedures to know: The POS is down\nExits: Resort IT Map (called 'Hot-Air Balloon' in the tour), Pier · Deliveries & Vendors (called 'Clubhouse Pier' in the tour), Pool · Data Lake, Guest Arrival & Wi-Fi (called 'Lakeside Patio' in the tour)", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.06, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 621, "prompt_s": 2.4, "gen_tokens": 88, "gen_s": 6.64, "tok_per_s": 13.2, "first_token_s": 2.42}}, "state": {}}

